fah-android: FAH-S hand pose estimation on Android with Vulkan

This Android implementation derives its network export and crop/decode formulas from
FAH and fah-metal. The Vulkan GELU shader adapts the MLX erf approximation carried by
fah-metal. Original notices are retained below and in licenses/.
ncnn is Copyright (C) 2017 Tencent and uses BSD-3-Clause; see licenses/ncnn.txt.
FAH weights are downloaded separately for local use; see licenses/FAH-WEIGHTS.txt.
The Android port does not include MANO fitting or MANO data.

